    "body": "## Summary\n\nPicks up DSanich's original work on #61 and extends it to cover worker-side matching and test coverage.\n\n- Add kebab-case and non-prefixed aliases for child-safety and underage report categories so all client wire formats (mobile camelCase, web kebab-case) resolve to human-readable labels in the moderator UI\n- Add all aliases to `HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES` for moderator-safety treatment (red badges, media collapse, sort priority)\n- Extract `UNDERAGE_CATEGORIES` and `CHILD_SAFETY_CATEGORIES` to `shared/categories.ts` — single source of truth for both worker and frontend\n- Fix ReportWatcher to match all underage aliases for age review case creation, not just `NS-underageUser`\n- Remove duplicate `HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES` from Reports.tsx (was drifting from canonical list)\n- Remove stale read-only preview banner from settings dashboard\n\n## Changes\n\n| File | What |\n|------|------|\n| `shared/categories.ts` | **New** — canonical underage + child-safety alias arrays |\n| `src/lib/constants.ts` | Add 6 missing CATEGORY_LABELS entries, spread shared arrays into HIGH_PRIORITY |\n| `src/lib/constants.test.ts` | Tests for new aliases and HIGH_PRIORITY membership |\n| `src/components/Reports.tsx` | Remove duplicate HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES, import from constants |\n| `src/components/SettingsDashboard.tsx` | Remove stale preview banner, update ABOUTME |\n| `worker/src/ReportWatcher.ts` | Match all underage aliases (was only NS-underageUser) |\n| `worker/src/ReportWatcher.test.ts` | 4 new tests for age review case creation across aliases |\n\n## Motivation\n\nMobile and web clients emit child-safety and underage report categories with different wire-format aliases (camelCase vs kebab-case, NS-prefixed vs bare). Without these mappings, the moderator UI shows raw category strings and the worker only triggers age review for one alias.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] `npx tsc --noEmit` — clean\n- [x] `npx vitest run` (frontend + worker) — all PR-related tests pass; 2 pre-existing failures in bulk-moderate.test.ts unrelated to this change\n- [x] `npx vite build` — clean\n\nCloses #61\n\nCo-authored-by: DSanich <124421399+DSanich@users.noreply.github.com>",
